# "Fractal" is a creature type word in Applied Geometry's rules text (CR 612.2), so a text-changing effect changes what its copy
# is: Bot1 casts Applied Geometry on Mox Ruby and, holding priority, its own Artificial Evolution on the spell, replacing
# "Fractal" with "Elf" (CR 612.1). The token copy of Mox Ruby is then an Elf creature in addition to its other types, not a
# Fractal (CR 707.9b, 612.2), with six +1/+1 counters.

[Bot1 Deck]
Applied Geometry
Artificial Evolution
Black Lotus
Mox Emerald
Mox Sapphire
Mox Ruby
Island x20

